'''Gabite''' (Japanese: '''ガバイト''' ''Gabite'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion.

