==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Gabite|98}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Gabite}}.
*'''Sharp Scythe''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Sharp Sickle''' on {{TCG ID|Fossil|Kabutops|9}} from the {{TCG|Fossil}} expansion.<ref group="nb">Kabutops uses hiragana (するどいかま) for the Japanese attack name, while all subsequent instances use katakana (するどいカマ) instead.</ref>
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

